Parts of this package (the wire syntax, the message envelope, the read-only
segment builders and the generic response parsing) are ported from fints-rs
0.2.0 by Florian Minnecker. They were adapted, not copied verbatim: the port
is read-only, drops the securities-depot request, adds the camt statement
request, uses a closed type for the HKTAN reference and reports characters
outside ISO-8859-1 as errors.
